WEBVTT

00:09:00.034 --> 00:09:03.228
I like to call this "intra-active."

00:09:04.090 --> 00:09:07.291
Normally, we think
about technology as interactive.

00:09:07.791 --> 00:09:10.502
This technology is intra-active.

00:09:11.562 --> 00:09:15.151
It understands what's inside of you

00:09:15.175 --> 00:09:17.540
and builds a sort
of responsive relationship

00:09:17.564 --> 00:09:19.561
between you and your technology

00:09:19.585 --> 00:09:23.540
so that you can use this information
to move you forward.

00:09:23.972 --> 00:09:28.434
So you can use this information
to understand you in a responsive loop.

00:09:28.894 --> 00:09:30.647
At InteraXon --